  "title": "Tradeweb Exchange-Traded Funds Update – June 2026",
  "summary": "Trading activity on the Tradeweb European-listed ETF marketplace reached EUR 84.3 billion in June and nearly EUR 240 billion in the second quarter of the year, the platform’s second highest quarterly volume on record. The proportion of transactions and notional volume completed via Tradeweb’s Automated Intelligent Execution (AiEX) tool amounted to 95% and 34%, respectively.",
